+Review the following planned bug fix and propose a concise regression checklist. Read-only text review; no local tool access, no edits. Answer in Chinese. Do not request delegation.
+
+Unity 6000.3.10f1 / Meta Interaction SDK 207.0.1, Quest via SteamLink OpenXR XRHands. Existing pipeline produces frozen HandSnapshot (connected/tracked/fresh/highConfidence, observedAt/version, per-finger confidence, joints/wrist-relative poses). SealFeatureExtractor uses official FingerShapes.GetValue on SnapshotHand:IHand. Raw Curl for straight fingers is ~180, flexed >200. Existing locomotion adapter incorrectly compares raw Curl <=25 for straight and >=45 for folded. Need use official SDK detection engine, not offset hack, preserve twelve-seal recorded profiles and raw recorded units.
+
+Proposed replacement: configurable ScriptableObject holds references to installed official FingerFeatureStateThresholds for index/middle/ring+pinky. Pure C# adapter directly instantiates official FeatureStateProvider<FingerFeature,string> (same core used by SDK FingerFeatureStateProvider) for each relevant finger. Feed only validated existing SDK features (no synthetic render hand). Each uses the actual hand observed timestamp as clock and monotonically increasing per-adapter evaluation sequence; never advance when same observation repeated. Gate at hand/finger feature validity, stale (>sampleMaxAge), source changes, backwards time, data gaps; reset SDK state on invalidation to prevent latched stale states. Compose left-pointing from index Open and other three Closed; right-open four Open; thumb ignored. These are game-specific simple ANDs over official states, not 12-seal recognition. Could allow other fingers NotOpen vs Closed if default too strict but initial explicit strict official states. No ShapeRecognizerActiveState native activation call required for core algorithm. Config and diagnostics Chinese; remove old 25/45 fields from serialized scene. Keep action FSM/dwell/cancel, fireball ownership unchanged. Check SDK hysteresis/min-time behavior with installed defaults, not online sample numbers.
+
+Tests should exercise actual SDK extraction from plausible synthetic bone chains and actual controller.ReadNavigationFrame, then action FSM; previous tests injected leftPointing/rightOpen booleans and missed unit error. Test starting/closing/reopening state, hysteresis, repeated timestamp, tracking loss/recovery, low confidence, missing/NaN joints/features, independent left/right timestamps, source switch, actual left/right mirrored geometry, default thresholds and scene wiring, cancellation and fireball priority unchanged. All existing editor+Play suites rerun; real headset accuracy remains unmeasured.
+
+Please identify important failure modes in this design and rank necessary tests; distinguish proven from speculative. Focus SDK state provider semantics, freshness and clock behavior, avoiding startup false positives and invalid-data retention. Do not propose unrelated architecture changes.
